    {
      "id": "3ff6c630-c178-81be-001e-a3c291b3785c",
      "title": "Aurora Launch Plan",
      "parent_id": "3ff6c630-c178-8154-233e-c4b0ae9a5996",
      "created": "{{-28T15:05|ts}}",
      "edited": "{{-3T15:25|ts}}",
      "content": "# Aurora Launch Plan\nVerdantis Aurora is a smart-home hub sold through retail partners, starting with Contoso Retail.\n## Goals\n- Launch the Verdantis Aurora smart-home hub in Contoso Retail stores on {{+22|long}}.\n- Every store has complete POS kits and trained staff before launch day.\n## Key dates\n- {{+9|md}} – POS kits ship to Contoso Retail stores\n- {{+15|md}} – Contoso Retail store staff training\n- {{+22|md}} – Launch event\n## Owners\n- Launch lead: Marcus Hollowell\n- Retail Ops approver: Sam Patel\n- Partner contact: Riley Blake (Contoso Retail)\n- Workstream owners: see the launch tracker\n## Rules\n- POS kits must include signage before staff training.\n- Partner shipment rules: see the [Retail Partner Launch Playbook](https://mock-verdantis-hub.yellowsand-9530f5dc.eastus.azurecontainerapps.io/retail/launch-playbook) on Verdantis Hub.\n## Links\n- Tracker: [Verdantis Aurora Launch Tracker](https://app.notion.com/p/3ff6c630c17881be58d02194129d9a85)\n- Decisions: [Launch Decision Log](https://app.notion.com/p/3ff6c630c17881af6f79a2640c43c229)"
    }
  ],
